00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:33.050
Sininho de Frota, Manuel Duca, Marco
Sobreiro, Marta Gonçalves, Messias Dias, Pedro Lobo, Pedro Matos, Queiroz Filho, Salmites,

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:37.110
